  "body": "`USDM_CT.xlsx` defines `Procedure.procedureType` (row 141, C188848 Procedure Type) as \"A characterization or classification of the study procedure.\", with Has Value List = N. In `dataStructure.yml` it is a string.\n\nThe same definition pattern elsewhere has a value list, for example `Endpoint.level` (row 73, C188826 Study Endpoint Level): \"A characterization or classification of the study endpoint that determines its category of importance relative to other study endpoints.\", Has Value List = Y (C188726).\n\nIn #79 the attribute was kept \"in case people are categorizing/classifying procedures\". As a free string, those classifications cannot be compared across studies.\n\nAsk: a value list for `procedureType` (or a binding to an existing code list), or a definition that says it is free text.\n\nFound while rendering USDM v4 as RDF: https://kerfors.github.io/usdm-overlay/id/finding/procedure-type-uncoded/",
